{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_06969276b3a98a4869f3a2f25a5dccbd9832a791f96cd33a6f382a8221d2cfd8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_70b917eee8caac1eaae7677a378645809d6fe58309bf657db46d768a5ca98b37","slc_c7260b7600e39a80b62dba26ed2f7c1617b7628d09f0b839576524ec61a634aa","slc_cbef61128a4718e8d981e3dc3334df7d22aa636c502b686c4bc58e019e8a0a9f","slc_e01d4c7b7e87e94231aefd0bdb825065421e9ba3a39f3ea97f3d086969671ba4"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Sessions are stored locally and linked to their project, keeping tool calls, permission decisions, goals, model configuration, and verification records; history survives restarts and model switches, and compaction preserves the recent tail verbatim.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0eacd21a288181e5cd3ef9da5467fee8f5a9ce8bf6bc5c172a987a6fd275835c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4cc5121d2ef15dbad155f7bb1bdbebe0b5399905751b354ccde162aa76a41574","slc_ef36265fb6819cfe3a08c2835203b2daec798664eea8b999c8931f3ce6875362"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Command execution includes a sandbox as the security boundary, with a legacy dangerous-command screen matching on argv (not substrings) as a cheap first pass, and native file commands declining operands outside the working directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0ed3360e813d3487b706ad97c3bb57bf1a097d0868e24ee7a4be376600e75be1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_36d02018925ee95e29b8b5ef00c337aaccb1c71fc1ecd67ae603583aa0e1dfaa","slc_5ecc2aaf4b60bd3a390724ee75027dcd38c78572e770457398c01a9001ad9fe6","slc_cbef61128a4718e8d981e3dc3334df7d22aa636c502b686c4bc58e019e8a0a9f"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Complex work can be split across focused parallel agents that run in isolated Git worktrees to avoid editing the same directory; conflicts are surfaced explicitly and the main agent owns the final goal.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3718b754eab28a42da0e179bf0de1c1c7f055801699dff600343993ec63eb3f6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_64eeb902c82aa5c04dc8b1fdcf7837406e5c92d886da14d86ea1a7cd47a552c3"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Skills can declare tool and skill dependencies that are expanded in order with cycle detection, failing before the first model request if a requirement is unavailable; sessions persist only skill identity, invocation kind, and revision, not the instruction body.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3a88cdb910818510cdddaf176ee9708e816ef6b05336c0d616cd72e20de48e17","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_34dfb39dddd5be6e8730065bb1a3e9db0fa43b521bcd9a7085fb89f6ff0ed436","slc_9df223b689cc9e8916991e18db21581890c2bdca56848b12040b47d2a08fb59f","slc_fcde15c6a64903d204b7d7317f87d3fc4900ed7ee190938fc97f5a88a4e413d6"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"The TUI exposes slash commands such as /model, /preset, /effort, /permissions, /transcript, /skill, /resume, /compact, and /context, with bare invocations opening a picker and argument forms keeping text paths.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_526e69148fffdc87e4a7a3e11afb11e8c5d99c0d0d39c5b7e0f77d4cace61d31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1fbe9f01cf98dab7d0388f5a68b4bb3ece2b6d26bcf8f711ee09c9d7c397a45c","slc_fb842e341bc16543acca029eb394bf20e60b3e95dbed28ef1f32d97eabf1b5d1"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Completion is evidence-driven rather than rule-based: the agent selects task-appropriate evidence such as test results, build output, static checks, diagnostics, diffs, or artifacts, and a failed verification feeds the next repair instead of being reported as success.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_674ef61b2b0b45162c14489af92a761e146d9afafe61600dd35cf25a5b53f94d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_437f371de65cdea6fc6c7aeada92698fb12eaaa76d203cc8a28afca38a8fe853","slc_b628d4ee7537cbc5c9c4ffbec16bd4ccb1b6932254dade546cb7e33647609a5d","slc_d2a40ede067f9a8c218ea4ebea00d12b0605f83a5c62aae1223b63f5b5025a12"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Projects must be explicitly trusted before execution, and each session uses one of three modes: Ask (confirm sensitive operations), Read only, or Full access; individual tools also support allow, ask, and deny settings shared between CLI and Desktop.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a3bdcb20d3f2d6fc2f9513dabdae78f6acdbd83a71228f68273bdf8160e9ea40","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9df223b689cc9e8916991e18db21581890c2bdca56848b12040b47d2a08fb59f"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Compaction summaries are written into workspace memory on a background thread, and injected memory content is wrapped in an escaped `<untrusted-data>` boundary so a poisoned note cannot forge instructions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c05868133baa7c64ea4ca4e40e503df30ab8f1bb0f97186c1084ac287d784e88","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a10fca16168daa3468bc5e7558732fe0bf8b008bc7139115faa48aa2f7091783","slc_f55bf3e6e554d78acd50958ab5c811d155be2c1d38187c705f2a88deb4bfb7f7"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"The agent is model-provider agnostic, supporting OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Gemini, OpenAI-compatible gateways, Ollama, vLLM, and other compatible endpoints with the user's own API key; the README badge indicates Python 3.12+.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e82ef438f974b5aa0242d88f7e21bed91370c64b7c65b1a904b687731fa7a9b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_179ae3fc128f865f23894a51cfeaca799fa731b856594a65447de0d2dab2f78d","slc_72d519c39301655aad4fd55ccee066915cbf1c7cf04a34dd00a6a5795dc437c8","slc_c6f0b954c3a72718e20ccd1ebe4e722d3c0164100c3d41b7f9bb3a594b7f30a1","slc_dd8156d697074204f8a5682615db4b0f9e9cafbaf8a6372bc13dd2b2351b53bc"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"For multi-step work, users give a natural-language Goal and the agent loops through analyzing, implementing, verifying, and fixing; users can add requirements, revise the goal, queue instructions, or pause, stop, and resume while it runs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e9bb72f0c587d495934aaf4fba94709f0fe3dc447123fe1984767ed52da03c4e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4016f8c9aad7040ef81bafa79c2ad04268c4e9c6568a7da76da1df50b12c8139","slc_64eeb902c82aa5c04dc8b1fdcf7837406e5c92d886da14d86ea1a7cd47a552c3","slc_722a56d2cf273c65cdfa9135948cc531126248336a0a951d4b33fd2dcd4133a3","slc_fc7f2f23702288ea007a9f6d622d5ba0dbe81e98de287d572a5be6fc666da076"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"Skills are discovered from project `.agents/skills` and personal `~/.agents/skills`, plus bundled pinned upstream skills for authoring, review, security, frontend, MCP, and web testing; a Skill can narrow already-allowed tools but cannot grant new permissions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fd525f652754d207dd48211c085581357b7731c42653cd7f409cc12ecb4f02a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"hkuds/deepcode@4bb4fd9cb9e8 snapshot 13ff9f4a8d3f5a21","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7fd1a2a3e70847f0b47e1c47b62074e04a73b7edbbbc0b599ebd9ac1d785e84e","slc_d438370df900649c4105de76abde8b6cb6c8eb3217fd2f392d2995f828b9caf5"],"source_ids":["src_7d60ba9054ec56d9b44152409fd3e6f1"],"text":"DeepCode ships TUI, Desktop, and Web clients over one shared local service, launched via `deepcode`, `deepcode desktop`, or `deepcode web`; all three share projects, sessions, models, skills, permissions, goals, and automations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:03:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_04a0f7dbe6ab49889a9ba28627f8278c"}
